    "section_faq_mLBhnV": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "block_qxLeyX": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is TB4-Frag?",
            "text": "<p>TB4-Frag is a bioactive fragment derived from thymosin beta-4 (TB4), a naturally occurring peptide in the body. It is designed to provide the benefits of full-length TB4 in an orally bioavailable form.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_xPjPHh": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the differences between Elementals' TB4-Frag, TB4 and TB-500?",
            "text": "<p>Both TB-500 and TB4-Frag are derived from the full peptide: TB4 or Thymosin Beta-4. TB4 Fragment: SDKP or Ac-SDKP, used in our TB4-Frag products, is a modified form of the peptide TB4. It is a shorter fragment of the original peptide, which has been found to have better oral bioavailability compared to the full-length peptide. This is due to its smaller size and modified structure, which allows it to be more easily absorbed by the body when taken orally.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_KqdKPH": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why should I choose Elementals' TB4-Frag over other TB4 Frag products?",
            "text": "<p>Our TB4-Frag is more potent than full-length TB4, providing similar or greater benefits at a lower dosage. It includes SNAC, to maximize absorption, and is delivered in delayed release capsules to ensure stability. It is 3rd party lab tested and manufactured in a cGMP-certified facility for quality and purity.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_9zY7jw": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this product third-party tested?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, our TB4-Frag is tested by a third-party laboratory for purity, potency, and authenticity. </p>"
          }
        },
        "block_8tmC9A": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What should I consider before taking this product?",
            "text": "<p>Before using this product it is recommenced to consult your healthcare professional. If you are taking any medications and/or have pre-existing medical conditions, it’s important to discuss potential interactions with your healthcare provider. Do not use if tamper seal is damaged.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_cTrLzz": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is this product manufactured and what product quality control tests are performed?",
            "text": "<p>Our products are manufactured in Nevada in a state-of-the-art, FDA-registered facility that meets or exceeds <a href=\"https://www.fda.gov/drugs/pharmaceutical-quality-resources/facts-about-current-good-manufacturing-practice-cgmp#:~:text=What%20is%20CGMP%3F,of%20manufacturing%20processes%20and%20facilities.\">current Good Manufacturing Practices (cGMP)</a>. Quality control testing is carried out at each stage of the manufacturing process, starting with rigorous raw material assessments and continuing through to finished product testing. </p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "block_6GzbB7": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Should I take this on an empty stomach or with food?",
            "text": "<p>Typically peptides are better absorbed when taken on an empty stomach. However, our TB4-Frag uses delayed release capsules, designed to bypass the stomach and slowly release in the small intestine. As a result, our TB4-Frag can be taken with or without food.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_F8CJBM": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this product vegan?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, it is also formulated without dairy, gluten or soy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_tm4zML": {
          "type": "block",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "What other supplements work synergistically with this product?",
            "text": "<p>Stacking any of the following can be beneficial depending on your health goals: BPC-157 can work synergistically on recovery after strenuous training. Collagen (type I & III) is vital for supporting connective tissues and joint health. Curcumin may support a healthier inflammatory response. Magnesium supports muscle function and offers stress support while reducing cramping. Omega 3's like DHA and EPA can also support a healthy inflammatory response and assist with overall wellbeing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_XUkFbi": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does it typically take to experience the benefits?",
            "text": "<p>The time needed to experience the benefits of TB4-Frag varies by individual. Many people will typically notice improvementsonly after 6-8 weeks. Regular supplementation is key to achieving long-term benefits.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
